== chatgpt
----------------------------------------
   Model
   * claude-subscription +  subscription
   * claude-work            subscription
   * claude-api             Claude API
   * chatgpt                subscription
 >   gpt-6.1-sol
     gpt-6-astra
   v 8 more
   Moves this chat to * chatgpt
   cache rebuild ~$0.10, subscription
   On chatgpt, earlier reasoning won't
   carry over.
   enter switch - esc close
